# Whitelist: ignore everything, then admit only the two website builds.
# Deliberate — the sibling folders hold competitor research, Figma text dumps
# and pricing work that shouldn't leave the machine, and a blacklist would let
# them slip in the first time someone runs `git add -A`.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!vercel.json

!website/
!website/**
!wordpress/
!wordpress/**

# The build scripts belong with the builds: home.html and the fenced HOMEPAGE
# block in style.css are GENERATED by tools/assemble-home.py, and both READMEs
# tell the reader to run it. Shipping the output without the generator would
# make the build unreproducible. tools/ holds only these scripts — no research,
# no Figma dumps, nothing the whitelist above exists to keep out.
!tools/
!tools/**

# --- never, under any circumstance --------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.claude/
